I worked my ass off trying to get this done but the GDREAM engine is now live. Everything in RAINBOW BASIC still applies. Here's the full list of commands:
GDREAM FINALUPDATE — COMMAND REFERENCE
=====================================

GLOBAL COMMANDS
----------------
HELP <topic>
HELP UPDATE
CLEAR
EXIT
MODE <WORD|FREEFORM|FMV|PLATFORM|EXEC>
FREEFORM ON/OFF
GUI
SCAN
UPDATE
EXPAND <keyword>
DEVKIT <platform> <command>
VICE PATCH <file> <offset_hex> <bytes_hex>


WORD MODE
---------
NOUN <word>
VERB <word>
ADJ <word>
COMPOSE

Examples:
  NOUN castle
  VERB rises
  ADJ ancient
  COMPOSE


FREEFORM MODE
-------------
DESCRIBE <text>
STYLE <style>
RENDER
EXPAND <keyword>

Examples:
  DESCRIBE a foggy forest
  STYLE vhs
  RENDER


FMV MODE
--------
FRAME <description>
FPS <number>
PLAY

Examples:
  FRAME hero enters room
  FPS 8
  PLAY


PLATFORM MODE
-------------
TILE <tile>
ENTITY <entity>
MOVE <entity> <direction>
GRAVITY <on|off>

Examples:
  TILE stone floor
  ENTITY player
  MOVE player right
  GRAVITY off


EXEC MODE
---------
ADMIN ON/OFF
AUDIT
PURGE
EXPAND <keyword>
DEVKIT <platform> <command>

Examples:
  ADMIN ON
  AUDIT
  PURGE
  EXPAND torch


DEVKIT — COMMODORE (RAINBOW PACKAGE)
-------------------------------------
BUILD / MAKE
FIND <value>
POKE <addr> <value>
FILL <addr> <length> <value>
MATCH <value>
ASM
STRICT <version>
ADD <command>
MEMFIT
SPRITE <id> <hexdata>
SECTION <name> <start> <end>
FLOAT
PRECISE <digits>
BLOCK <x> <y> <id>
XPOKE <addr> <value16>
